      "description": "Dedicated detailed export. Initial delivery/backfill is asynchronous. Null amounts mean pending or unavailable, never zero. Credits are negative; Net = Gross + Credits. Dates grouped in Asia/Bangkok. Restricted to the AppSheet project; query capped at 100 MB billed.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
